### SoundWave API — peticiones de ejemplo
### Requiere la extensión "REST Client" de VS Code (humao.rest-client).
### Haz clic en "Send Request" sobre cada petición, en orden.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Planes disponibles (público, no requiere token)
GET {{base}}/subscriptions/plans

### 2. Registrar un cliente nuevo
# @name register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@correo.com",
  "password": "MiClave#2026",
  "displayName": "Ana López",
  "country": "GT"
}

### 3. Iniciar sesión (guarda los tokens automáticamente)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@soundwave.local",
  "password": "Demo#2026Seguro"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 4. Mi perfil
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Petición SIN token → 401
GET {{base}}/users/me

### 6. Listar canciones (paginado, ordenado por popularidad)
# @name tracks
GET {{base}}/tracks?page=1&limit=5&sort=popular
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@trackId = {{tracks.response.body.data[0].id}}

### 7. Búsqueda global
GET {{base}}/search?q=luna&type=track,artist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Reproducir canción (Free = vista previa con anuncios)
POST {{base}}/tracks/{{trackId}}/play
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Dar "me gusta"
PUT {{base}}/users/me/liked-tracks/{{trackId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Crear playlist
# @name playlist
POST {{base}}/playlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Para programar",
  "description": "Música para concentrarse",
  "isPublic": true
}

@playlistId = {{playlist.response.body.id}}

### 11. Agregar canción a la playlist
POST {{base}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "trackId": "{{trackId}}" }

### 12. Ver la playlist
GET {{base}}/playlists/{{playlistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Suscribirse a Premium (pago simulado con token de pasarela)
POST {{base}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "planId": "premium", "paymentToken": "tok_visa" }

### 14. Renovar el access token
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### 15. Intentar endpoint de admin con usuario normal → 403
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- ADMIN ----------

### 16. Login como administrador
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@soundwave.local",
  "password": "Admin#2026Seguro"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 17. Listar usuarios (admin)
GET {{base}}/users?search=demo
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. Crear artista (admin)
# @name artist
POST {{base}}/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nuevo Artista", "genre": "Indie", "country": "GT" }

### 19. Crear álbum (admin)
# @name album
POST {{base}}/albums
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "artistId": "{{artist.response.body.id}}",
  "title": "Primer Álbum",
  "releaseDate": "2026-10-01",
  "type": "album"
}

### 20. Crear canción (admin)
POST {{base}}/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "albumId": "{{album.response.body.id}}",
  "title": "Canción de prueba",
  "durationMs": 195000,
  "explicit": false
}

### 21. Cerrar sesión
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }
